On Wednesday night, July 15th, Himemori Luna's super-miracle-ultra major announcement stream will be held,

636
01:00:53,096 --> 01:00:56,896
みんなすべからく見るのだ！
so everyone absolutely must watch it!

637
01:00:57,056 --> 01:00:58,016
んーーーな！
Nnnna!

